### IMDB System HTTP Test File
### Use this file with REST clients like VS Code REST Client extension or Postman

### Test 1: Check if application is running
GET http://localhost:5078/api/movies?page=1&pageSize=5

### Test 2: Check persons endpoint
GET http://localhost:5078/api/persons?page=1&pageSize=5

### Test 3: User Registration
POST http://localhost:5078/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser_new",
  "email": "testuser_new@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Test 4: User Login
POST http://localhost:5078/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Test 5: Verify Token (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE with actual token from login)
GET http://localhost:5078/api/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test 6: Get All Users (protected endpoint - replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE)
GET http://localhost:5078/api/users
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test 7: Movie Search
POST http://localhost:5078/api/movies/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "searchTerm": "action",
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### Test 8: Person Search
POST http://localhost:5078/api/persons/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "searchTerm": "smith",
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### Test 9: Framework String Search (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE)
POST http://localhost:5078/api/framework/search/string
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "userId": 1,
  "searchString": "test"
}

### Test 10: Framework Name Search (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE)
POST http://localhost:5078/api/framework/search/names
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "userId": 1,
  "searchString": "john"
}

### Test 11: Toggle Movie Bookmark (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE and MOVIE_ID)
POST http://localhost:5078/api/framework/bookmarks/movies/toggle
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "userId": 1,
  "movieId": 1
}

### Test 12: Rate Movie (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE and MOVIE_ID)
POST http://localhost:5078/api/framework/rate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "userId": 1,
  "movieId": 1,
  "rating": 8
}

### Test 13: Get Movie Details (replace MOVIE_ID with actual movie ID)
GET http://localhost:5078/api/movies/1/details

### Test 14: Get Person Details (replace PERSON_ID with actual person ID)
GET http://localhost:5078/api/persons/1/details

### Test 15: Get User Movie Bookmarks (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE)
GET http://localhost:5078/api/framework/bookmarks/movies/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test 16: Get User Person Bookmarks (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE)
GET http://localhost:5078/api/framework/bookmarks/persons/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test 17: Get User Notes (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE)
GET http://localhost:5078/api/framework/notes/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test 18: Get Search History (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE)
GET http://localhost:5078/api/framework/search-history/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test 19: Get Rating History (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE)
GET http://localhost:5078/api/framework/rating-history/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test 20: Find Co-Actors
POST http://localhost:5078/api/framework/search/coplayers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actorName": "Tom Hanks"
}

### Test 21: Get Popular Actors in Movie (replace MOVIE_ID)
GET http://localhost:5078/api/framework/popular-actors/1

### Test 22: Get Similar Movies (replace MOVIE_ID)
GET http://localhost:5078/api/framework/similar-movies/1

### Test 23: Person Words
POST http://localhost:5078/api/framework/search/person-words
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personName": "Tom Hanks",
  "topN": 10
}

### Test 24: Exact Match Titles
POST http://localhost:5078/api/framework/search/exact-match
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keywords": ["action", "movie"]
}

### Test 25: Best Match Titles
POST http://localhost:5078/api/framework/search/best-match
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keywords": ["action", "movie"]
}

### Test 26: Keyword Expansion
POST http://localhost:5078/api/framework/search/keyword-expansion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keywords": ["action", "movie"]
}
